Bundled third-party code
========================

1. Prague Sky Model implementation
----------------------------------

Files derived from, adapted from, or incorporating code from the Prague Sky
Model implementation by Petr Vevoda and collaborators, including code based on
the upstream files:

  src/PragueSkyModel.h
  src/PragueSkyModel.cpp

Upstream project:
  https://github.com/PetrVevoda/pragueskymodel

Copyright:
  Copyright (c) Charles University
  Implementation repository and software by Petr Vevoda

Notes:
  The upstream Prague Sky Model repository provides the implementation and
  associated notices. Those notices are kept in source file headers rather than
  duplicated here.

