3. ArHosek / Hosek-Wilkie sky model code
----------------------------------------

Files derived from, adapted from, or incorporating code from the ArHosek sky
model, including code based on the upstream files in:

  atmosphere/model/hosek/

Upstream source used:
  https://github.com/ebruneton/clear-sky-models/tree/master/atmosphere/model/hosek

