4. Moon texture
---------------

Bundled file:

  inst/textures/lroc_color_poles_1k.jpg

Provenance:
  Derived from NASA Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter Camera (LROC) lunar image
  data. The exact upstream source page and local processing chain are not
  recorded in this repository; the filename and package usage identify it as
  an LROC color lunar texture with polar coverage.

Rights/provenance:
  NASA-origin imagery is public domain in the United States unless a specific
  third-party restriction is identified. No additional non-NASA restriction
  for this bundled texture was found in this repository.

